<title>USA: Eclipse gets OK to market laser in Europe.</title>
<headline>Eclipse gets OK to market laser in Europe.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eclipse Surgical Technologies Inc Wednesday said it had received approval from Conformite Europeene Mark to market its medical laser product in the European Community.</p>
<p>Eclipse's Transmyocardial Revascularization lasers are used to treat patients with advanced cardiovascular disease.</p>
<p>&quot;The CE Mark allows Eclipse to formally launch our TMR lasers in Europe through our international distributor, Sorin Biomedica Cardio S.p.A., one of the leading open-heart surgery supply companies in Europe,&quot; Douglas Murphy-Chutorian, Eclipse chairman and chief executive, said in a statement.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
